            <h3>Solid Surfaces</h3>
            <p>Merino Hanex solid surfaces enable seamless fabrication across interior applications.</p>
            <a class="featured-interiors__button" href="/brand/merino/solid-surface">Know More <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="brand-type-card fade-up" data-delay="540">
          <img src="/assets/images/brands/merino/merino-fabwood.jpg" alt="Fabwood high-performance surface solution" />
          <div class="brand-type-card__content">
            <h3>Fabwood</h3>
            <p>High-performance surface solutions for furniture and interior applications.</p>
            <a class="featured-interiors__button" href="/brand/merino/fabwood">Know More <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></a>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div> 
