  <%- include("../../../partials/board-help-cta") %>

  <section class="brand-faq" aria-labelledby="merinoFaqTitle">
    <div class="container-lg">
      <div class="brand-faq__layout">
        <div class="brand-faq__intro">
          <p class="txt-light">(Merino &amp; Chawla Plywood)</p>
          <h2 id="merinoFaqTitle">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
          <p>Learn how Chawla Plywood helps match Merino surface solutions to your interior project.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="brand-faq__list">
          <details open>
            <summary>How does Chawla Plywood work with Merino?</summary>
            <p>Chawla Plywood brings Merino laminates, panels, solid surfaces, and Fabwood options together with practical product guidance for interior projects.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>How can Chawla Plywood help me choose the right solution?</summary>
            <p>Share your application, room, desired look, and performance needs. Our team can help compare suitable Merino products, finishes, and surface options.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Can you help with homes as well as commercial interiors?</summary>
            <p>Yes. We help homeowners, architects, interior designers, contractors, and businesses select surfaces for furniture, kitchens, wardrobes, workspaces, and retail interiors.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>What information should I share before choosing a surface?</summary>
            <p>Tell us where the surface will be used, the expected daily wear, moisture exposure, dimensions, and your preferred finish or colour direction.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Can you help coordinate finishes across my interior?</summary>
            <p>Yes. We can help you compare matte, gloss, woodgrain, solid, stone, patterned, and textured Merino finishes for a coordinated interior look.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>How do I get started?</summary>
            <p>Use the enquiry form above to share your requirement. The Chawla Plywood team will help you shortlist the right Merino solution for your project.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
